8:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Song 8:7\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(22,8,7)\">Song 8:7</ref> <bdbheb>גֶּשֶׁם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>שׁוֺטֵף</bdbheb> <highlight>flooding rain</highlight> (of <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb>'s judgement) <ref ref=\"Ezek 11:11\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(26,11,11)\">Ezek 11:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 11:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,11,13)\">Ezek 11:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 38:22\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(26,38,22)\">Ezek 38:22</ref> <bdbheb>נַחַל שׁוֺטֵף</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 66:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,12)\">Isa 66:12</ref>, simile, in good sense. — Abs. <ref ref=\"Dan 11:26\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(27,11,26)\">Dan 11:26</ref> see <b>Niph`al</b> — Figurative of <highlight>dashing, rushing</highlight> horse, <bdbheb>בַּמִּלְחָמָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כְּסוּס שׁוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 8:6\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(24,8,6)\">Jer 8:6</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>flow, run</highlight>, literal of <bdbheb>נַחַל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 78:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,20)\">Ps 78:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,4)\">2Chr 32:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> literally, <highlight>rinse</highlight> or <highlight>wash off</highlight>, with accusative of thing washed <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:38\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,38)\">1Kgs 22:38</ref>, <bdbheb>יָדָיו</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בַּמָּ֑יִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 15:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"15\" 